en:
xxx:
Is downloading from the internet easier than searching on the computer, you say?

xxx:
Here's the sequence:
the economist contacted the software suppliers;
the suppliers billed for FineReader software;
the accounting paid these bills;
the courier brought a package of licensed software;
the admin installed and configured the software.

xxx:
And all because our secretary was too lazy to retype two pages of text.
Yes, the admin also scanned and recognized — "That's working with a program!"
